    "description": "### Impact\r\nUsers who lost access to a topic (e.g., removed from a private category group) could still interact with polls in that topic, including voting and toggling poll status. No content was exposed, but users could modify poll state in topics they should no longer have access to.                                                                                    \r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nUpgrade to patched version.\r\n",
